    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφῐλο-νεικέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>vie with</i> another <i>in</i>
			anything, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισὶ πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					2.19.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cling stoutly to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ δόξῃ τῇ αὑτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					343b25
				</span></i>
			; <i>persist in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Charito
					5.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>insist, contend</i>, c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> abs., <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				5.11.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.648d
			</span></i>.</div>
